{
    "version": 6,
    "bundle": "TD42AYNXL7L5JWL54ZSLJMRYWCHBL4RR",
    "type": "story",
    "storyId": "041118004",
    "title": "ひとときだけの契約を",
    "enTitle": "A Momentary Contract",
    "text": [
        {
            "jpName": "",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "――あれからずっと、ネオユニヴァースの言葉の意味を考えていた。",
            "enText": "I've pondered the meaning of Neo Universe's words \nsince our last encounter.",
            "nextBlock": 2,
            "origClipLength": 85,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 316,
                    "pathId": -4043530755782989013
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -1953847039497478906,
            "blockIdx": 1
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ネオユニヴァース",
            "enName": "Neo Universe",
            "jpText": "あなたの“窓”は――“修復”……。\nアドマイヤグルーヴの“窓”は――“喪失”……。",
            "enText": "…Admire Groove's Window reflects Loss… \nYours reflects… Restoration.",
            "nextBlock": 3,
            "origClipLength": 317,
            "voiceIdx": 0,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 302,
                    "pathId": 6286444669181553883
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 3900810932899360720,
            "blockIdx": 2
        },
        {
            "jpName": "",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "正直、何を言われているのかはちっともわからない。\n自分とアドマイヤグルーヴが同時に見ている謎の夢についても。",
            "enText": "Frankly, I don't have a clue what she's talking about. \nNor what's up with that strange dream I seem to have \nshared with Admire Groove.",
            "nextBlock": 4,
            "origClipLength": 115,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "……でも――",
                    "enText": "However…",
                    "nextBlock": 4
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 302,
                    "pathId": 8356606790379590089
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 8441767997994897052,
            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "わからないことだらけ。だがただ一つ、確かなことがある。\n――彼女が今、独りきりで、苦しんでしまっているということだ。",
            "enText": "Incomprehensible as it all is, one thing is still clear \nto me — she's currently suffering, and alone.",
            "nextBlock": 5,
            "origClipLength": 120,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 302,
                    "pathId": -8849713763648157125
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 60,
                    "pathId": -1533468940481022662
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 5774236599400242174,
            "blockIdx": 4
        },
        {
            "jpName": "",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "スティルインラブについて、繰り返し見続けている悪夢。\nそれに苛まれているというのなら――",
            "enText": "If this recurring nightmare that's tormenting her \ninvolves Still in Love, then…",
            "nextBlock": 6,
            "origClipLength": 102,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "（まずは……その原因を取り除く！）",
                    "enText": "(Problems are solved… at their source!)",
                    "nextBlock": 6
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 32,
                    "pathId": 4748386228160182494
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 7892126444030786623,
            "blockIdx": 5
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "……今回はなんのご用ですか？\nスティルさんについて……こんな山積みの書類を持ってきて。",
            "enText": "…What business do you have with me <i>this</i> time? \nCarrying all these documents on Still in Love, no less…",
            "nextBlock": 7,
            "origClipLength": 281,
            "voiceIdx": 1,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "彼女と戦うつもりなら、目を通してほしい",
                    "enText": "You should have a look at them, \nif you want to take her on.",
                    "nextBlock": 7
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 381,
                    "pathId": -7136430944237517586
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 158,
                    "pathId": 1890973464843262055
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 213698734269359205,
            "blockIdx": 6
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "（……この人は、私が彼女と戦ったことを知っていた……。\nそれになぜか、悪夢で見る相手が彼女であることまで……）",
            "enText": "(…This person knows about my race with her… \nMore than that, somehow they're even aware \nthat she shows up in my nightmares…)",
            "nextBlock": 8,
            "origClipLength": 357,
            "voiceIdx": 2,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "役に立たないと思えば、破り捨てて構わない",
                    "enText": "$(scale 80)If these aren't useful, you can just throw them away.",
                    "nextBlock": 8
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 393,
                    "pathId": 7763318167817980704
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 208,
                    "pathId": 3358225738842222341
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 3449792503754104719,
            "blockIdx": 7
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "……わかりました。\nでも……私に関わるのは、これきりにしてください。",
            "enText": "…Fine. But… I would ask that you leave me alone after that.",
            "nextBlock": 9,
            "origClipLength": 252,
            "voiceIdx": 3,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 208,
                    "pathId": 2811718594381577990
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": -8353255940061867662
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -4342085236618976657,
            "blockIdx": 8
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "――これは……このデータは……。\n私と……彼女の……？",
            "enText": "This data… It's on both of us…?",
            "nextBlock": 10,
            "origClipLength": 204,
            "voiceIdx": 4,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "最近の成長分も含めた、現状の戦力比較だ",
                    "enText": "Comparisons including the very latest \ndevelopments, yes.",
                    "nextBlock": 10
                },
                {
                    "jpText": "最近の成長分も含めた、現状の戦力比較だよ",
                    "enText": "Comparisons including the very latest \ndevelopments, yes.",
                    "nextBlock": 10
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 254,
                    "pathId": 6977275634446148018
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -5444043006974788627,
            "blockIdx": 9
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "彼女、公式のタイム等のデータは殆ど存在しないはずですが。\n……これだけのデータ数、張りついて計測したというのですか？",
            "enText": "I thought official data on her was near nonexistent. \nTo have this much of it… did you follow her around \nand calculate it by yourself?",
            "nextBlock": 11,
            "origClipLength": 328,
            "voiceIdx": 5,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 357,
                    "pathId": 6016839053632360927
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 192,
                    "pathId": 2371898191481154074
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 7340973757309910377,
            "blockIdx": 10
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "……それにしても、このひと月あまりで急速に成長してるわね……。\nなにか、きっかけでもあったのかしら……？",
            "enText": "…I must say, she certainly has been improving rapidly \nover the past month, judging by this… Could something \nhave happened to her to cause this…?",
            "nextBlock": 12,
            "origClipLength": 300,
            "voiceIdx": 6,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "どうだろう。身の回りの環境が変わったとか",
                    "enText": "$(scale 85)Hard to say. Perhaps a change in her environment?",
                    "nextBlock": 12
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 357,
                    "pathId": -2386385849819035831
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 317,
                    "pathId": -8498416747427001410
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -4442676725832192965,
            "blockIdx": 11
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "環境……ですか。理屈としてはわかりますけど――\nいえ、憶測で語っても意味はありませんね。",
            "enText": "Her environment… That sounds reasonable, but… \nNo, there's no point to speculating.",
            "nextBlock": 13,
            "origClipLength": 347,
            "voiceIdx": 7,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 359,
                    "pathId": 328337789929771061
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 50,
                    "pathId": 2709870174394288805
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -5166918806791912823,
            "blockIdx": 12
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "……それで、貴方はこのデータを見せて私にどうしろと――\nこれは……彼女への、対策……？",
            "enText": "…So, what do you expect me to gain from this da— \n…Are these countermeasures? Against her…?",
            "nextBlock": 14,
            "origClipLength": 371,
            "voiceIdx": 8,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 357,
                    "pathId": -7604386545968552649
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 184,
                    "pathId": 3554817898627483142
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 3674135740769365980,
            "blockIdx": 13
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "……つまり、作戦を変えるべき、と。",
            "enText": "…In short, you think I should try a different style of running?",
            "nextBlock": 15,
            "origClipLength": 153,
            "voiceIdx": 9,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "ああ、“差し”でいくべきだと思う",
                    "enText": "Yeah. I have you down as a surger.",
                    "nextBlock": 15
                },
                {
                    "jpText": "うん、“差し”でいくべきだと思う",
                    "enText": "Yep. I have you down as a surger.",
                    "nextBlock": 15
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 221,
                    "pathId": -8469633371466307808
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 23,
                    "pathId": -6087706634864751336
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 23,
                    "pathId": -4609507654781437616
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -4775425710038431538,
            "blockIdx": 14
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "（――集中力の乱れによるペース崩れ……映像も残ってない\nあの併走を一度見ただけで、これほど詳細に分析を……）",
            "enText": "(—— \"Loss of concentration leading to disrupted pace\"… \nThis is a lot to pick up on and analyze from a quick race \nwith no recordings. Simply by watching…)",
            "nextBlock": 16,
            "origClipLength": 308,
            "voiceIdx": 10,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 292,
                    "pathId": 4357267480491226135
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 196,
                    "pathId": 9075231397298019782
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -3755596340624899882,
            "blockIdx": 15
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "（前を走る先行策では、プレッシャーに呑まれる可能性が高い。\n故にそうならない後方から、一気に差し切る作戦……か）",
            "enText": "(Since there's a higher likelihood of succumbing to pressure \nwhen running nearer the front, they suggest taking up position \nfurther back, surging through later…)",
            "nextBlock": 17,
            "origClipLength": 366,
            "voiceIdx": 11,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 496,
                    "pathId": 8315627547155712914
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": 5600399651893922566
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -2784083863578712484,
            "blockIdx": 16
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "（……確かに。首筋に牙を突き立てられるようなあの時間は、\n一秒でも短い方がいいわ）",
            "enText": "(…I can't deny I'd rather keep that feeling of fangs \nready to sink into my neck to a minimum.)",
            "nextBlock": 18,
            "origClipLength": 280,
            "voiceIdx": 12,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 113,
                    "pathId": -70685679484616516
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 167,
                    "pathId": 5984533793607746124
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 4543924566922255958,
            "blockIdx": 17
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "けれどこれをやるには、より前半のペースを抑えながら、\n成長している彼女を差し切るだけの脚が必要です。",
            "enText": "However, to pull this off, not only will I need to further control \nmy pace early on, I'll need the leg power to surge past her even \nas she continues to improve.",
            "nextBlock": 19,
            "origClipLength": 293,
            "voiceIdx": 13,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "そのためのメニューも全て組んである",
                    "enText": "$(scale 94)I already drew up a regimen with this in mind.",
                    "nextBlock": 19
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 411,
                    "pathId": -6427235616125897021
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": -653458967347973903
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -4332311230028463539,
            "blockIdx": 18
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "……貴方は、何故こんなことを……？",
            "enText": "…What do you gain out of doing this?",
            "nextBlock": 20,
            "origClipLength": 134,
            "voiceIdx": 14,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "君に……勝ってほしい。ただそれだけだ",
                    "enText": "I just… want to see you win. Nothing more.",
                    "nextBlock": 20
                },
                {
                    "jpText": "貴方に……勝ってほしい。ただそれだけだよ",
                    "enText": "I just… want to see you win. Nothing more.",
                    "nextBlock": 20
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 208,
                    "pathId": 3876811105504390910
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -6351558044309729087,
            "blockIdx": 19
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "ですが――貴方は私のトレーナーでもない。\nこんなことをする職責も義理もないでしょうに。",
            "enText": "Even so… you aren't even my trainer. \nYou hold no responsibility or obligation to any of this.",
            "nextBlock": 21,
            "origClipLength": 242,
            "voiceIdx": 15,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "それは今関係ない。乗るか、乗らないかだ",
                    "enText": "That's irrelevant now. Are you in, or not?",
                    "nextBlock": 21
                },
                {
                    "jpText": "それは今関係ない。乗るか、乗らないかだよ",
                    "enText": "That's irrelevant now. Are you in, or not?",
                    "nextBlock": 21
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 215,
                    "pathId": -8400491430716633321
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": 103637453939387867
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 216029285480159445,
            "blockIdx": 20
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "（……口ぶりからして、なにか理由があるのは確かなようね……）",
            "enText": "(…The way they talk, they do seem to have \nsome ulterior motive…)",
            "nextBlock": 22,
            "origClipLength": 169,
            "voiceIdx": 16,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 255,
                    "pathId": 2621534056126628372
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 1612371933552506539,
            "blockIdx": 21
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "（でも、日増しに力が強まる彼女と戦うには、彼女より早く\n成長する必要があるわ。今は……実利には適うならそれでいい）",
            "enText": "(Nevertheless, if I want to take the fight to her, I must exceed \nher own rapid rate of improvement. At the moment… anything \nthat gives me an edge is welcome.)",
            "nextBlock": 23,
            "origClipLength": 439,
            "voiceIdx": 17,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 565,
                    "pathId": -5817357129807340736
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 549,
                    "pathId": -69428089839298969
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 687379051837435499,
            "blockIdx": 22
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "……わかりました。\n貴方の案――乗りましょう。",
            "enText": "…Fine then. I'll accept your proposal.",
            "nextBlock": 24,
            "origClipLength": 181,
            "voiceIdx": 18,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 89,
                    "pathId": -3379256134174179352
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": -5305612593537296484
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -4523042108754369375,
            "blockIdx": 23
        },
        {
            "jpName": "",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "――そして数週間後。",
            "enText": "Several weeks later…",
            "nextBlock": 25,
            "origClipLength": 58,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 14,
                    "pathId": 5575115544653583386
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -4330132467082286364,
            "blockIdx": 24
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "（――ここまでは作戦通り……。あの人の戦力分析・展開予測とも\nほぼほぼ一致している……これならば――差し切れる！）",
            "enText": "(Everything is following expectations so far… Both her ability \nand the race situation closely match that trainer's predictions. \nI'm confident I can surge past…!)",
            "nextBlock": 26,
            "origClipLength": 333,
            "voiceIdx": 19,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 418,
                    "pathId": -3782312048517575349
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 374,
                    "pathId": -2996745983933852613
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 144,
                    "pathId": -779921573602348074
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 7583115164703548352,
            "blockIdx": 25
        },
        {
            "jpName": "スティルインラブ",
            "enName": "Still in Love",
            "jpText": "――あぁ……いい……いいわ……。\n感じるもの……美味しそうな……魂……！",
            "enText": "<i>Ahhh</i>… Yes… <i>Yeeessss</i>… \nI sense… the presence… of a delectable soul…!",
            "nextBlock": 27,
            "origClipLength": 326,
            "voiceIdx": 20,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 23,
                    "pathId": 7686584326669826862
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 35,
                    "pathId": 5997214551496463046
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 52,
                    "pathId": -7571758124111534739
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 8232627625407715158,
            "blockIdx": 26
        },
        {
            "jpName": "スティルインラブ",
            "enName": "Still in Love",
            "jpText": "……アハハはハハははははッ！！\nもっと、もぉっと！！　愉しみましょぉおぉ！？",
            "enText": "…𝐀ha𝐡𝐚ha𝐡𝐚h𝐚ha𝐡a!! \nMore, moo𝐨re!! Let us enjoy this to the fulle𝐞eest!",
            "nextBlock": 28,
            "origClipLength": 296,
            "voiceIdx": 21,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "雰囲気が、豹変した……！？",
                    "enText": "Her aura completely changed…!?",
                    "nextBlock": 28
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 321,
                    "pathId": -673320631644843876
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 260,
                    "pathId": -4604555700580293414
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 178,
                    "pathId": 1082346811908832740
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": 1124526511124893601
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -576505384086910163,
            "blockIdx": 27
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "（っ……！　やはり出てきた……！\n……でも……ここからならば……！）",
            "enText": "(…! I knew there was something! But… you're too late!)",
            "nextBlock": 29,
            "origClipLength": 185,
            "voiceIdx": 22,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 321,
                    "pathId": -6857424760855246821
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": -1706425084680015865
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 249,
                    "pathId": -3603889243027454450
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 106364438690716010,
            "blockIdx": 28
        },
